Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:50.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在宇宙最寒冷的地区 凶残的奥格都·杰哈德 混乱七神 沉睡在他们的水晶禁地之中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:57.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等待着重新掌控大地 焚毁天堂 德斯·维尔密斯传说 第87页
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:02.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么使一个男人成为真正的男人呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it that makes a man a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是他的出身 他的本源?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it his origins, the way things start?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:10.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是其它一些难以说清的东西呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it something else, something harder to describe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:14.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而对我来说 这一切始于1944年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, it all began in 1944.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在苏格兰海岸执行的一次秘密任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Classified mission off the coast of Scotland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:20.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纳粹们已经走投无路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nazis were desperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:22.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们试图利用黑魔法和科学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Combining science and black magic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:26.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打破战争的平衡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they intended to upset the balance of the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:32.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我28岁时就已成为罗斯福总统的灵异现象顾问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was 28, already a paranormal advisor to President Roosevelt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:36.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我从未想到那晚发生的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could never have suspected that what would transpire that night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:40.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不仅改变了历史的进程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would not only affect the course of history...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.30,0:01:42.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还永远改变了我的一生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but change my life forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:44.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 小伙子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, men, let's go. Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:48.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(苏格兰 1944年10月9日)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们上 上啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:55.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,分散开来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's fan it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your men...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they'll need these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是天主教徒吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a Catholic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:12.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 还有其他原因 不过这很难说清{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Among other things. But that's hardly the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.79,0:02:14.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 你需要这个东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're gonna need one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:17.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我痛恨使用暴力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l abhor the use of violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:21.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 我希望你别把我当疯子 魏特曼士官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. l wouldn't want you to think me mad, Sergeant Whitman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:23.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经三天了 现在想这个太晚了 布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, three days too late for that, Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:27.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子们 出发吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you guys, let's move, move, move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:33.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小伙子们 上 上啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on boys, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这边走! 左面 右面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way! Left, right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:37.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上啊 快啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, men, let's get the lead out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:38.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就要到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:42.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在浪费我们的时间 这岛上除了绵羊和岩石什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting our time. There's nothing here but sheep and rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是遗迹 不是岩石 - 就在那里停下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ruins, not rocks. - Hold it right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:48.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是特隆德汉姆·阿比的遗迹 建在草地边界的交叉点上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The remains of Trondham Abbey, built on an intersection of ley lines...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:50.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是人类世界和其他世界的边界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the boundaries between our world and the others...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:52.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,废话连篇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a load of crap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 一周前 我还没听说过"反常现象"这个词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, a week ago, l never even heard the word ''parabnormal.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:57.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是灵异现象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paranormal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,前进!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:01.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保持阵型!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:03.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来此一定是为了绵羊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must be here for the sheep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:38.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个带防毒面具的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The freak in the gas mask....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:40.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔·卢布里切特·克鲁南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karl Ruprecht Kroenen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:46.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希特勒的头号杀手 北方神秘协会的头目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hitler's top assassin and head of the Thule Occult Society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:50.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他在这里 那比我想像的还要糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf he's here, this is worse than l thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:18.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不论今晚发生了什么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what happens tonight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:21.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...这本书都会把你带回我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this book will guide you back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会离开你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l will not leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.19,0:04:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将赐予你不朽的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l grant you everlasting life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:29.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不褪的青春{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...youth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:32.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及辅佐我的魔力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the power to serve me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:37.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊萨! 格里高利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}llsa! Grigori!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:53.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五年的研究和建筑啊 格里高利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five years of research and construction, Grigori.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五年!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five years!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,元首不会容忍失败的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fuhrer doesn't look kindly on failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:04:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将军 不会失败的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no failure, general.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:03.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我向元首保证将有一个奇迹出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l promised Herr Hitler a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:08.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会带来一个奇迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll deliver one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚所作的一切将永世流传!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What l will do tonight can never be undone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:21.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚所作的一切将永世流传!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What l will do tonight can never be undone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会打开地狱之门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l will open a portal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:26.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唤醒奥格都·杰哈德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and awaken the Ogdru Jahad:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:29.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混乱七神!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Seven Gods of Chaos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的敌人将被毁灭!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our enemies will be destroyed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:34.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,废墟中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And from the ashes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:39.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个新的伊甸园将诞生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a new Eden will arise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:05.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卧倒!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:10.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想拍张照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was taking a picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:12.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再拍我就砸掉你的像机!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do that again and l'll carve you a new one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:15.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 传送门已经打开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, the portal is open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand? We have to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,手雷! 手雷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}grenade! grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊! 冲啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:51.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:37.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多结束了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's almost over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:38.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,传送门打开的时间太长了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The portal's been open for too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能有东西已经从那边过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something may have come through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:48.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你手下彻底搜索整个区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have your men search the area thoroughly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:54.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搜查那边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spread out over that way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:00.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 这上面有东西!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir! Something up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,暂时而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说有些东西会过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you said something came through....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:13.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从哪里来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}From where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:20.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也没有看到!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't see them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:31.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的相信地狱存在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really, really believe in hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个黑暗的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a place, a dark place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:39.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,远古的魔鬼在那里沉睡 等待着回归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where ancient evil slumbers and waits to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:43.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 格里高利今晚让我们一窥地狱 - 格里高利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grigori gave us a glance tonight. - Grigori?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.34,0:10:45.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是俄国名字 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Russian, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:48.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格里高利·艾菲莫维奇·拉斯普亭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grigori Efimovich Rasputin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:49.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉斯普亭?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rasputin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:53.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快说啊 - 俄国沙皇的神秘学顾问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Occult adviser to the Romanovs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:56.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在1916年的一次晚宴上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln 1916, at a dinner in his honor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:11:01.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被下毒 枪击 刀刺 棒打...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he was poisoned, shot, stabbed, clubbed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:04.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...阉割 最后沉湖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...castrated and finally drowned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们今晚却看见了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet, we saw him here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:10.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:16.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful. Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.49,0:11:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是个什么鬼东西? 猿猴吗? - 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is that? An ape? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是红色的 亮红色的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt was red. Bright red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:46.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把灯放低点 你吓到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower your light, you're scaring it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:50.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们两个在射击什么?  - 一只红色猿猴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you two shooting at? - A red ape!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:52.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是猿猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not an ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他手里有个大石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's got a big stone in its hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:59.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想那就是他的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l think that is its hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:01.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那锤子怎么那么大啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the size of that whammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:06.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 等一下 等等!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:41.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我件毯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A blanket. Get me a blanket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:48.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 来啊 这很安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on. lt's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.93,0:12:49.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跳下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 跳下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Jump down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:58.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是个男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是个小婴孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's just a baby boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往左一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:15.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 我成为了一个怪胎的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we were, an unready father for an unwanted child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:19.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在当晚就给他取了个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boys gave him a name that very night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回想起来 这名字并不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In retrospect, perhaps not the most fortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:26.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我们也叫习惯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But nevertheless, a name we all came to use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:30.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们叫他"地狱男爵"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We called him Hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:34.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看镜头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the birdie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:50.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于他的起源有很多猜测{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speculation about the origins....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:58.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有证据说地狱男爵...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evidence that Hellboy....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(联邦调查局和小怪物做交易)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你说情报机关到底做了什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what is it exactly that you say this agency does?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:16.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不骗你 它捕杀怪兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kid you not. It hunts monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人声称 这个生物...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The claim, of course, that this creature...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:28.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为联邦调查局工作 捕杀怪兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...works for the FBI as a monster hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:44.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《地狱男爵》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(摩尔达维亚 伯尔高山口　现代)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.37,0:15:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要找的在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you seek is in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:03.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个神圣的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a sacred place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我金子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me my gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.77,0:16:14.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:12.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们对你的眼睛做了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they do to your eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.41,0:17:30.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你告诉他了吗 - 还没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you told him yet? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:31.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(纽约 列克星敦肿瘤学中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:32.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:44.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恶性肿瘤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Malignant sarcoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:46.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在肺里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln the lungs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:49.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脊椎上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the spine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:52.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有肝里 - 我大概...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...liver. - Approximately...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:57.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还能活多久? - 也许六个星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...how long? - Maybe six weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:02.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以替你安排住院治疗以缓解疼痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l can arrange for hospitalization and pain management.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:06.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让你在最后时光好受些 - 不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make the time more bearable. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:09.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我更愿待在家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'd rather be at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:13.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有一些事要安排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have some arrangements to make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:19.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以随时来住院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can always get a second opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:26.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没必要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.61,0:18:32.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点! - 在这儿等着!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry up! - Wait right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:39.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆·曼宁是联邦调查局特殊行动部的负责人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tom Manning is the head of special operations at the FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:41.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他今晚来我们演播室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He joins Pat in the studio tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谈谈最新的地狱男爵目击照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}to go over the latest Hellboy sighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:46.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里 这就是尾巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. That's the tail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:49.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而这些是角{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these are the horns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:50.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:52.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(汤姆·曼宁 联邦调查局特殊行动部负责人)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.99,0:18:56.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些异形 飞碟 雪人 地狱男爵的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the pictures of aliens, UFO, the yeti, Hellboy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他们总对不准焦距?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why is it they're always out of focus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有关灵异现象研究和国家安全局的情况呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about the Bureau of Paranormal Research and Defense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:08.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你 我想告诉全美公众一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l wanna tell you, l wanna tell the American public one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么局来着?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this Bureau for the....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.01,0:19:13.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,灵异现象研究和国家安全局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paranormal Research and Defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:19.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根本不存在这个机构{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:27.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(灵异现象研究和国家安全局 新泽西州 纽沃克)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:38.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"废物处理部门"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}“Waste Management Services”?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:41.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·迈尔斯 联邦调查局的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Myers, FBl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:47.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从匡提柯总局调来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transfer from Quantico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看镜头 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the birdie, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.41,0:20:15.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好 我是约翰... - 你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. l'm John... - You are late. That's what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:18.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 迟了五分钟 - 是的 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five minutes. - Yes, l know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:22.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要去... - 51区 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l'm going to... - Section 51 . l know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:25.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心你的手和肘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your hands and elbows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么? - 小心你的手和肘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pardon? - Watch your hands and elbows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:06.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请替我翻一页 如果你不介意的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn the pages, please, if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.27,0:21:12.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:14.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,翻一页{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:16.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些? 你在读这些?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}These? You're reading these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:17.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一次读四本书 天天如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four books at once, every day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:19.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一次读四本书 天天如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four books at once, every day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:19.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一次读四本书 天天如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four books at once, every day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.77,0:21:22.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我能在这里替他翻书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as long as l'm there to turn the pages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:23.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫布隆姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:24.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫布隆姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:26.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特瑞沃尔·布隆姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Trevor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 我是约翰...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, l'm John...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:30.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,探员约翰·T·迈尔斯 1976年生于堪萨斯城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent John T Myers, Kansas City, '76.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:32.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,T代表的是赛德尔斯 母亲的兄长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}T stands for Thaddeus, mother's older brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十岁的时候下巴有了个疤痕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar on your chin happened when you were 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在指望有天它可以自动消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still wonder if it's ever going to fade away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它怎么... - 是"他"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did it... - He.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是"它"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not ''it.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:45.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕·赛皮恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abraham Sapien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.57,0:21:49.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在华盛顿圣特里南弃婴医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Discovered alive in a secret chamber...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:52.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个秘室中被发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of St. Trinian's Foundling Hospital, Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字是用...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name was taken from this inscription...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.61,0:21:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他生活的水柜旁边的说明文字取的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...stuck to the side of his tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:57.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"伊斯欧·赛皮恩"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''lcthyo Sapiens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"1865年4月14日"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}April 14, 1865.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:02.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕·林肯死的那天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day that Abraham Lincoln died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:05.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此我们都叫他艾比·赛皮恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence, Abe Sapien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:08.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,腐烂的蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rotten eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:11.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很妙不是吗 艾比喜欢吃这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A delicacy. Abe loves them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:14.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎知道我这么多事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does he know so much about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:17.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾比有个特殊的大脑额叶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe possesses a unique frontal lobe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.93,0:22:23.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"特殊" 在这里你会常听到这词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Unique.'' That's a word you'll hear frequently around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.67,0:22:28.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 我到底是在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, where am l, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:32.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你进这房间时 该看到一句铭文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you entered the lobby, there was an inscription:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:37.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"没有光明的地方 黑暗将大行其道"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''ln the absence of light, darkness prevails.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,夜里有些东西很活跃 迈尔斯探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are things that go bump in the night, Agent Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.19,0:22:42.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不要搞错这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make no mistake about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:47.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我们就是反击那些家伙的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we are the ones who bump back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:54.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1937年 希特勒参加了北方协会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1937, Hitler joins the Thule Society...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.07,0:22:58.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一群沉迷于神秘学的德国贵族建立的组织{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a group of German aristocrats obsessed with the occult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:03.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1938年 他得到了朗基奴斯圣矛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1938, he acquired the Spear of Longinus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那柄刺穿了主耶稣身体的圣矛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which pierced the side of Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:07.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,持有圣矛的人会无敌于天下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He who holds it becomes invincible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.75,0:23:10.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希特勒的权力增长了十倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hitler's power increases tenfold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:14.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1943年 罗斯福总统决定反击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1943, President Roosevelt decides to fight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:17.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,灵异现象研究和国家安全局就此诞生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bureau of Paranormal Research and Defense is born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:21.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1958年 神秘学战争由于...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1958, the Occult Wars finally come to an end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:24.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿道夫·希特勒的死而结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with the death of Adolf Hitler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:27.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说1945年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1945, you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:29.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希特勒是45年死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hitler died in '45.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.77,0:23:32.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he, now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.84,0:23:37.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯 这是克里探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myers, this is Agent Clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:39.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他带你去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take his lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:41.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会向你做介绍的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll make the introductions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.45,0:23:47.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:52.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我亲手把你从70个大学毕业的新人中挑出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l handpicked you from a roster of over 70 academy graduates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.99,0:23:54.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make me proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not speaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布隆姆教授把他关起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Broom had him grounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:02.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关起来? 谁被关起来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grounded? Who's grounded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.91,0:24:14.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 你看到那鱼人了对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You saw the fish guy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:16.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 真奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. That was weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.15,0:24:18.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.93,0:24:29.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 进来吧 见见其他家庭成员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, come on in. Meet the rest of the family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:31.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一天要吃六次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets fed six times a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:33.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got a thing for cats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.50,0:24:36.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会是他的保姆 他的保护人 他最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be his nanny, his keeper, his best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.90,0:24:39.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人监护 他不许外出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never goes out unsupervised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.44,0:24:40.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.98,0:24:48.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨那些漫画书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l hate those comic books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.78,0:24:51.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总是画错我的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never get the eyes right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.42,0:24:58.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.76,0:25:00.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他真的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:02.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按照记录他已经60岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}60 years old by our count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.64,0:25:04.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过他的年龄和我们的有所不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he doesn't age like we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.53,0:25:07.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想想看 狗就比我们活得短 他现在还没到二十{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think reverse dog years. He's barely out of his 20s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.07,0:25:09.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的头发怎么样 克里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the hair, Clay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于去植发了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally got them implants, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.51,0:25:14.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会长起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt'll fill in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.41,0:25:16.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the squirt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.44,0:25:19.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯探员是你的新联络员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Myers is your new liaison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.68,0:25:23.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't want him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.15,0:25:27.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 克里 你烦我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you get tired of me, Clay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.92,0:25:29.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那糖果 给他糖果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The candy. Give him the candy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.02,0:25:32.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 先生 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sir, l....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.29,0:25:34.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我带了这个给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have these for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.53,0:25:36.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸回来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father's back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.40,0:25:39.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还在生气?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He still angry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.91,0:25:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你上次确实是逃跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you did break out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想见她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l wanted to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.27,0:25:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 又不关其他人的事 - 但是 你又把自己弄上电视了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody's business. - lt is. You got yourself on TV again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.14,0:25:48.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,姓迈尔斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myers, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.18,0:25:51.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有名字吗 迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a first name, Myers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:54.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要盯着看 他不喜欢人盯着他看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try not to stare. He hates it when people stare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:58.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 约翰·迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}John. John Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:26:00.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 叫我约翰就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, John'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.29,0:26:04.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要盯着什么看? - 他的角 他把角挫平了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stare at what? - His horns. He files them to fit in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.00,0:26:14.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 你看什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you looking at, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.47,0:26:19.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 没有 没什么 什么也没看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no. Nothing. Nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:21.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红色警报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.58,0:26:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红色警报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning. Code red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:25.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正找我们呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're playing our song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.85,0:26:29.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 冠军 我们去干掉一些怪兽吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, champ, let's go fight some monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:37.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们在麦肯图书馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here at the Machen Library...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.56,0:26:40.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几小时前 这里的警报被触发了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where just hours ago, an alarm was triggered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.49,0:26:43.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约市警察对此还没有发布任何声明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The N.Y.P.D. has yet to issue a statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:47.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过这里有特种部队装甲车 还有军医{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got SWAT vans, paramedics. You name it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.20,0:26:49.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在又开来辆垃圾车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now here comes a garbage truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.47,0:26:51.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一辆巨大的垃圾车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A large garbage truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:56.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这些丑陋的家伙 蓝鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at them ugly suckers, Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.71,0:26:59.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们和他们之间只隔一扇玻璃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One sheet of glass between them and us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.51,0:27:01.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一生都是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Story of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.45,0:27:05.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外面的世界 我终于可以出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside. l could be outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:10.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 出去找她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, outside with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.19,0:27:12.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别找我的茬 哥们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get psychic with me, fella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.63,0:27:14.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没找你的茬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing psychic about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.86,0:27:16.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.33,0:27:19.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这样怎么能泡到妞? 开辆垃圾车来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am l gonna get a girl? l drive around in a garbage truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.27,0:27:22.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹把我们抛弃了 红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz left us, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.20,0:27:24.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接受她的暗示吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the hint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.84,0:27:26.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才不接受什么暗示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't take hints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:38.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到达目的地了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civilians in bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.57,0:28:02.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 兄弟们 我们把跟踪器同步一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys, let's sync up our locators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:10.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把门封上 红大个和蓝鱼就要进来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the doors. Red and Blue are coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.18,0:28:13.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,19点整 警报被拉响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}19 hours, an alarm was tripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.62,0:28:17.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报告说发现了一个大怪物 第五型的 极具攻击性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A large entity, type 5, reported. Very aggressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.22,0:28:18.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六名警卫已经被杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six guards dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.56,0:28:20.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们检查过这个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l thought we checked this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.53,0:28:21.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是假警报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fakes and reproductions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:24.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显 不是什么东西都是假的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, not everything was fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:38.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怪物还在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entity is still in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.41,0:28:43.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从监视器上可以看到 一座十六世纪的雕塑被破坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Video surveillance shows a 16th-century statue was destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.62,0:28:45.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大法官圣狄奥尼修斯的雕塑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}St. Dionysius the Areopagite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:48.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 用来驱魔的雕像 - 正是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who wards off demons. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.69,0:28:53.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过那个雕像 却是中空的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The statue, however, was hollow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个圣骨箱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A reliquary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:57.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个囚室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:29:00.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梵蒂冈认为它所囚禁的怪物极其危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vatican deemed its occupant dangerous enough...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.83,0:29:05.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此把它列入了亚维农名单 这名单我们也有一份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to include it on The List of Avignon, of which, by the way, we hold a copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.61,0:29:07.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect job for these babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:09.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made them myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.01,0:29:14.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有圣水 丁香叶 银屑 白橡木 这肯定有效{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy water, clove leaf, silver shavings, white oak. The works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:21.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这扇门后面 有一个黑暗的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind this door, a dark entity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.72,0:29:26.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凶狠 古老 而且饥饿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evil, ancient and hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:30.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好啊 让我进去和它打个招呼吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well. Let me go in and say hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.86,0:30:01.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好查查资料 蓝鱼兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better hit the books, Brother Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:04.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们肯定需要关于这家伙的更多信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll definitely need more info on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.17,0:30:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人和他一起去? 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, no one goes with him? Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.50,0:30:09.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He likes it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.04,0:30:13.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孤胆英雄嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole ''lonely hero'' thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.45,0:30:30.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,粘鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Stinky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.79,0:30:34.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,厨房已经打烊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitchen's closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.06,0:30:36.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你都吃了点什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you having?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.16,0:30:40.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,生吃了六个图书馆警卫 还有腰带和靴子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six library guards, raw, plus belts and boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.40,0:30:44.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 你得多吃点素的才能消化掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you're gonna need some heavy fiber to move that out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.74,0:30:46.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个 我发现了些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red, I found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.04,0:30:49.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这已经绝迹的怪物叫萨莫艾尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This entity's name is Sammael, the desolate one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.98,0:30:51.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼尔加之子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of Nergal, brother of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:06.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 萨莫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Sammy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.26,0:31:11.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我枪法不怎么准 不过这枪的子弹可不小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'm not a very good shot, but The Samaritan here uses really big bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.97,0:31:23.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们来个漂亮和平的方式如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you say we work this out in a nice, peaceful....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.25,0:31:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.86,0:31:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨莫 不听话就这种下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it for you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.63,0:31:46.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个 你应该听听其余的信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red, you need to hear the rest of the information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.63,0:31:48.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 他被解决了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.90,0:31:50.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 听听这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.34,0:31:55.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨莫艾尔 已绝迹的种类 黑暗的领主...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Sammael, the desolate one, lord of the shadows...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.38,0:31:58.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼尔加之子 能够重生...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...son of Nergal, hound of resurrection.... ''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.31,0:32:03.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}See...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.25,0:32:04.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l don't like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:06.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢什么? 能够重生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Hound of resurrection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.55,0:32:10.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"瘟疫的前兆 毁灭的萌芽"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Harbinger of pestilence. Seed of destruc...''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.36,0:32:12.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直接说关键部分吧 我怎么杀掉它?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut to the end. How do l kill it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.89,0:32:14.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这上面没说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:22.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到前面去 冲啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the front. Let's go! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:23.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我绕到后面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm going around the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.53,0:32:48.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.39,0:32:50.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.80,0:32:53.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都长大了啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All grown up, l see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:56.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.27,0:33:00.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你听过的第一首催眠曲 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt was the first lullaby you ever heard, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.54,0:33:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我引领你来到这个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l ushered you into this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.24,0:33:07.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有我知道你的真名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l alone know your true calling, your true name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.68,0:33:09.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛 那这个叫什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.90,0:33:31.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那东西 那东西 - 你认为你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That thing. That thing. - What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:34.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你认为你在干什么? - 帮你啊 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think you're doing? - Helping you. l...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.67,0:33:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人能帮我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody helps me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:37.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的工作!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.95,0:33:44.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想帮忙吗 这里 帮我上子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to help? Here. Load this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.69,0:33:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是跟踪弹 把弹头弄破{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a tracking bullet. Crack the pin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.69,0:33:54.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你胳膊上是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, what's that on your arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.19,0:33:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.93,0:34:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那东西到底是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:05.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我去问问它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.13,0:34:29.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 继续前进 不错 继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, keep coming. Good. Keep coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.13,0:34:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛 你这个小...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, you little....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.46,0:34:56.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.09,0:35:01.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正冲向平民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're heading toward civilians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.91,0:35:15.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮的化妆对吧? 不给糖果就捣蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy costumes, huh? Trick or treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.20,0:35:46.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红灯就意味着停车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red means stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:02.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吧? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.19,0:36:04.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,待在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.10,0:36:18.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨莫 你有伤口了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy, you got a leak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.08,0:36:27.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在等我吗 大脸怪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting for me, chunk-face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.45,0:36:34.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.52,0:37:12.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我和你都是一个头的 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l'm on your side. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.60,0:37:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:44.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,张开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open wide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.06,0:37:50.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,娘的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.77,0:37:55.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恶心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.54,0:37:57.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝这个吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.29,0:38:14.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕火的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm fireproof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.89,0:38:16.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.76,0:38:25.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:28.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在 我在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Yeah? Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.37,0:38:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你胳膊怎么样了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's your arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.20,0:38:33.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我胳膊没事 你在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, my arm's fine. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.44,0:38:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚把粘鬼炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l just fried Stinky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:37.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.51,0:38:39.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉老爸我会回家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tell Father l'll be home...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.21,0:38:40.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过让他别等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he shouldn't wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.81,0:38:42.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别别 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.38,0:38:43.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I gotta go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.98,0:38:46.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 迈尔斯 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Myers. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.62,0:38:50.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:54.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.66,0:39:22.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(废弃地下铁衣帽间)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.77,0:40:11.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨莫艾尔完成了他的使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammael has fulfilled his destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,愿他安息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die in peace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.07,0:40:17.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等待下一次的重生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and be reborn again and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.68,0:40:25.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离月蚀还剩七天了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only seven more days till the eclipse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.12,0:40:30.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子会到那里去 我们也会去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The child will be there, and so will we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.59,0:40:32.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.51,0:41:18.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(贝尔拉米精神病医院 轻症监护组)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.51,0:41:23.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那有个大个子的红人在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a big, red man down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.98,0:41:26.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 没事 圣诞老人还要一个月才能来呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fine, darling. Santa's not here for another month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.01,0:41:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是圣诞老人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Santa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.95,0:41:30.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, who, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.76,0:41:43.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我带啤酒来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l brought beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.90,0:41:45.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 红大个 你的胳膊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Red, your arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.53,0:41:49.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好找医生看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get that looked at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.98,0:41:58.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l wanted to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.54,0:42:26.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一次媒体见到他 就跑来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time the media gets a look at him, they run to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.64,0:42:28.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经没有谎话可说了 特瑞沃尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm running out of lies, Trevor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.41,0:42:30.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还以为你喜欢上电视呢 - 我是喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l thought you like being on TV. - l do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.28,0:42:34.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过今年他已经逃跑五回了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how many escapes this year alone? Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.01,0:42:37.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆 他是我们的客人 不是囚犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tom, he's our guest, not a prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.42,0:42:39.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的客人可是有六英尺五英寸高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your guest is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.81,0:42:41.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亮红色皮肤 长尾巴 而且由政府供养{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a tail and is government-funded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.82,0:42:42.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道去哪里找他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know where to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.66,0:42:46.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我会把他弄回来的 - 鱼叉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l'll get him back. - Hey, fish stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.63,0:42:47.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.96,0:42:50.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须碰才能看见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l need to touch it to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.33,0:42:53.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看见什么? - 过去 未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See what? - Past, future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.33,0:42:57.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何和这个东西有关的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever this object holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.17,0:42:58.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是说真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ls he serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.47,0:43:01.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心指纹 我从来没有指纹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about fingerprints. Never had any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.64,0:43:06.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教授 他们来过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor, they were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.78,0:43:13.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来过? 尼克松? 胡迪尼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was here? Nixon? Houdini?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.42,0:43:15.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吉米·胡佛? 谁啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy Hoffa? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.49,0:43:19.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看 艾比 让我看看这里发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me, Abe. Show me what happened here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.61,0:43:36.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是东翼检查组 一切正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is east-wing check-in. We're all clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.91,0:43:41.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外 记住把副馆的展品都锁起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, make sure it's all locked up over there in the annex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.22,0:43:44.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.14,0:44:12.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克鲁南!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kroenen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.78,0:44:14.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.00,0:44:31.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.63,0:44:33.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.31,0:44:44.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们从这里掩护他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll cover him from here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.18,0:44:48.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 不要动 放下那东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, don't move! Put that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.98,0:44:50.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把武器放下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put down the weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.98,0:44:51.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去对付他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.15,0:44:53.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.12,0:44:57.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,趴在地上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.23,0:45:03.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最后警告!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last warning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.77,0:45:11.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.03,0:45:41.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 准备欢迎它吧 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, ready the welcome, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.94,0:45:52.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,数千个天使的眼泪凝结的盐粒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salt gathered from the tears of a thousand angels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.64,0:45:54.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,封印了地狱犬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Restraining the essence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.81,0:45:58.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨莫艾尔的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of Sammael, the hellhound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.98,0:46:02.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭的萌芽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The seed of destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.33,0:46:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次我可以向你保证 萨莫艾尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This l can promise, Sammael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.94,0:46:20.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一个你倒下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For each one of you that falls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.21,0:46:21.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个新的你就会重生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...two shall arise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.08,0:46:59.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 教授 - 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Professor. - l'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.55,0:47:02.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.82,0:47:07.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.89,0:47:11.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来病得很重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are very sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.56,0:47:15.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望地狱男爵知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't want Hellboy to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.76,0:47:21.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六十年前 他们试图毁灭世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty years ago, they tried to destroy the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.40,0:47:22.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们又回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.47,0:47:27.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的残生中 他们又回来了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln my lifetime, they're back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.44,0:47:30.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完成他们未尽的使命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to finish the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.25,0:47:34.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在局里很怀念你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We miss you at the bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.08,0:47:37.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾比每天都更疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abe's crazier every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.52,0:47:39.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸还是对我发脾气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father's still mad at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.99,0:47:45.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回来吧 丽兹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back, Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.96,0:47:48.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回来吧 - 不 不行 地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come back. - No. No, H.B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.86,0:47:52.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 现在不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.03,0:47:56.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't like it here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.14,0:48:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我已经几个月没有幻觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but l haven't had an episode in months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.18,0:48:05.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.41,0:48:09.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始能控制它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm learning to control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.55,0:48:13.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道它的来源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm learning where it comes from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.22,0:48:17.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我生命中第一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the first time in my life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.89,0:48:20.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不再感到害怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'm not afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.17,0:48:31.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看来接你的车已经来了 - 让护送人员待命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looks like your ride is here. - Have escort stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.94,0:48:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保姆小队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nanny Squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.11,0:48:39.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 站住 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stop. Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.28,0:48:43.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 能让我先进去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, may l go first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.22,0:48:44.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.08,0:48:46.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱男爵对他还不熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He barely knows him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.72,0:48:50.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就让他自己来改变这点吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he should make it his business to change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.16,0:48:56.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, H.B...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.80,0:48:59.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里还有希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l've got a chance out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.03,0:49:02.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的关心我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you really care about me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.67,0:49:08.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就不要再来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you won't come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:21.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.55,0:49:22.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l gotta go too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.02,0:49:26.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多事要做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.73,0:49:37.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么你这么久才进来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.91,0:49:42.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 该回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, time to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.24,0:49:45.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮你包扎伤口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tape you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.98,0:49:50.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么 多愁善感的童子军吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you, a Boy Scout?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.85,0:49:55.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 我从未当过 - 好吧 你可能骗过了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nope, l never was. - Well, you could have fooled me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.69,0:49:58.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.46,0:50:01.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你流了好多血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. You've lost a lot of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.23,0:50:02.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.83,0:50:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该知道是什么能让我真正受伤 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what'll kill me, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.40,0:50:08.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 红大个 让我们带你回去吧 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Red, let's get you home. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.39,0:50:32.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你被一些有机酸烧伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were burned by some organic acid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.66,0:50:34.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我够走运的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm lucky that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.99,0:50:38.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我很担心你 - 担心我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l worry about you. - Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.80,0:50:42.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.20,0:50:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我不会永远活着 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l won't be around forever, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.37,0:50:47.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.84,0:50:50.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能小心点吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you please be a little careful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.11,0:50:52.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 大块头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.94,0:50:55.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它抓住你有多长时间?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long was it latched onto you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.78,0:50:58.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不太清楚 大概五秒钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know. About five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.38,0:51:02.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 教授 看 - 严重吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Professor, look. - ls it bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.69,0:51:07.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住你五秒钟 就下了三个蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touched you five seconds, laid three eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.89,0:51:09.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也不给我买杯饮料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't even buy me a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.73,0:51:18.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刺鳌从舌头上分离 把蛋注入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stinger detaches itself from the tongue and injects the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.14,0:51:23.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们对于光线和温度极其敏感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are very sensitive to heat and light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.04,0:51:29.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们需要潮湿黑暗的环境生长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need a humid, dark environment to breed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.58,0:51:31.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有没让他离开过你的视线?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever lose track of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.29,0:51:34.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个 让我想想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.95,0:51:38.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当火车从我头上开过去的时候 我没有看住他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was that moment when l had the train on top of my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.09,0:51:40.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't risk it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.93,0:51:44.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天你和一组探员回到铁轨那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow you'll go back to the tracks with a group of agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.40,0:51:47.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把整个地区彻底搜索一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search the whole place top to bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.37,0:51:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到那些蛋 除掉它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find those eggs and destroy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.95,0:52:02.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"伊丽莎白·谢尔曼"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Elizabeth Sherman.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.08,0:52:05.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢"点火器"这个称呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like the term ''fire-starter. ''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.08,0:52:07.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.69,0:52:11.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而"火焰风暴"听起来又好像精神错乱什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And "pyrokinesis" sounds like some psychosis or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.79,0:52:13.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.69,0:52:15.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许那是对的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.39,0:52:17.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能对这点释怀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not being able to let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.93,0:52:19.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.83,0:52:24.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一次幻觉后我都会昏过去 有时数小时之久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I black out after each episode. Sometimes for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.04,0:52:27.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听说过很多...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear about so and so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.51,0:52:30.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人们无法自控而歇斯底里的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who just lost control and just exploded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.21,0:52:31.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们很走运 因为那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're lucky it isn't true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.74,0:52:34.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但对我来说却是真实的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}With me, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.49,0:52:51.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的主人在呼唤你的名字 我的女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My master is calling your name now, my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.83,0:52:54.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须回到小孩的形态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must return to the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.83,0:52:56.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以再一次...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So once again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.37,0:52:59.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梦见...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...dream...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.01,0:53:02.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,圣火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.86,0:53:20.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怪胎!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, freak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.56,0:53:23.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到这里来 怪胎!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back here, freak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.33,0:53:24.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们去捉弄她! - 捉弄她!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get her! - Get her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.53,0:53:27.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伙计们 捉弄她! - 看这个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get her, guys! - Watch this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.87,0:53:29.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怪胎!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.67,0:53:36.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要! 不要再来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.71,0:53:39.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要! 来人啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.21,0:53:40.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.81,0:53:43.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我! 来人啊! 救救我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, somebody! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.33,0:54:33.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她还得烧掉多少座建筑?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many buildings does she have to burn down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.40,0:54:35.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她属于这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She belongs here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.53,0:54:36.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她不这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what she feels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.44,0:54:39.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她可能永远不会回来了 这是她的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She may never feel it. lt's her choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.44,0:54:41.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教授 那女孩...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor, the girl you're...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.94,0:54:46.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教授 你正谈及的那女孩...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor, that girl you're talking about....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.95,0:54:47.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,侦察员小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Boy Scout...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.95,0:54:48.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,童子军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Boy Scout...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.45,0:54:49.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想好再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...think twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.71,0:54:51.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 听着 我读了她的档案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, listen, l read her file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.72,0:54:54.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- "读了她的档案" - 她在自责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ''Read her file.'' - She blames herself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.89,0:54:56.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了那场美国匹兹堡的那场爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for that explosion in Pittsburgh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.77,0:54:58.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我能帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I think I can help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.92,0:55:01.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以去和她谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l could talk to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.43,0:55:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我能把她带回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l think l could bring her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.70,0:55:07.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么让你得到这个送"煎饼"的工作?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what was it that landed you this job pushing ''pamcakes,'' huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.40,0:55:08.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.07,0:55:12.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的守时? 还是你摆弄发型的方式?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punctuality? The way you part your hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.27,0:55:14.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的专业领域是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your area of expertise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.11,0:55:18.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不想我和他在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't want me with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.88,0:55:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.25,0:55:22.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你做得很好 - 不 我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're doing fine. - No, l'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:24.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他尊敬的是克里 不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, he respects Clay, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.69,0:55:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 行了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm really sorry, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.56,0:55:31.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你要的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm not your guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.89,0:55:35.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我快死了 迈尔斯探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm dying, Agent Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.16,0:55:40.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像其他父亲一样 我很担心他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like any father, l worry about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.50,0:55:46.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在中世纪传奇故事里都会有一位年轻的骑士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln medieval stories, there is often a young knight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.40,0:55:49.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有多少经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who is inexperienced...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.08,0:55:53.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但却有着纯真的心 - 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...but pure of heart. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.85,0:55:56.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有什么纯真的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, l am not pure of heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.68,0:56:01.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉斯普亭回来找他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rasputin is back for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.59,0:56:03.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一要你做的就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What l ask of you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.52,0:56:07.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我离去后在他身边勇敢地支持他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is to have the courage to stand by him when l am gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.46,0:56:11.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他天生就是恶魔 这无法改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was born a demon. Can't change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.23,0:56:13.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你能帮助他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you will help him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.03,0:56:15.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从本质上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in essence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.53,0:56:18.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成为一个男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to become a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.59,0:56:34.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把那个拉下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.75,0:56:36.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她本来复原得很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was making great progress...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.82,0:56:37.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在却发生了这事故{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and now this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.16,0:56:40.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会关门数月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be closed for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.33,0:56:42.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这造成我们氯丙嗪药剂供应的短缺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it put a big dent in our Thorazine supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.66,0:56:46.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事故发生后 她就一直这个样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's been like this since it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.13,0:56:51.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你想进去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you want to go in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.54,0:57:01.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢尔曼女士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Sherman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.65,0:57:04.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是联邦调查局的迈尔斯探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm Agent Myers, FBl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢尔曼女士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Sherman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.52,0:57:14.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能叫你丽兹吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can l call you Liz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.36,0:57:16.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美丽的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's a beautiful name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.96,0:57:20.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全世界百分之六十的女性都叫丽兹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty percent of all the women in the world are named Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.47,0:57:25.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 但我个人非常喜欢这个名字 我叫约翰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's impressive by my standards. My name's John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.80,0:57:28.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·T·迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}John T. Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.91,0:57:31.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布隆姆博士要我邀请你重回部门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Broom asked me to invite you back to the bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.54,0:57:35.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有特殊的预防措施 没有安全人员的护送{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No special precautions, no security escorts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.35,0:57:38.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像普通人 你和我坐出租车回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just you and me in a taxi like regular folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.82,0:57:41.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不像是他说的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't sound like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.79,0:57:45.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢尔曼女士 他在请求你回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Miss Sherman, he's asking you back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.32,0:57:47.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你可以做出自己的选择 知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it's entirely your choice, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.86,0:57:49.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,选择?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choice, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.56,0:57:51.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那中听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.53,0:57:54.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经离开过这部门十三次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l've quit the bureau 13 times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.03,0:57:57.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我每次又总是回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l always go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.44,0:57:59.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有其它什么地方可去的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where else would l go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.42,0:58:18.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"废弃的地铁空地"在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.39,0:58:22.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过那些蛋需要黑暗潮湿的环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said those eggs need it dark and humid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.06,0:58:25.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们这回可中大奖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they hit the jackpot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.16,0:58:28.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在地铁线 它们全集中在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The subway lines, they all converge right around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.70,0:58:31.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们正下方 有座古老的凡迪维尔水库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right below us is the old Vandeveer reservoir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.27,0:58:33.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水库在30年代中期就被废弃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt was abandoned in the mid-30s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.27,0:58:34.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有脉冲信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a pulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.18,0:58:40.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那里 在另一边有个蓄水池{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. A cistern on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.45,0:58:46.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大多数蛋都在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the eggs are there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.69,0:58:49.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有路进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.52,0:58:53.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该回去申请特别的二号类型许可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go back and request a special permit, type 2...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.61,0:59:13.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们来还是不来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys coming or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.57,0:59:36.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会带你过一种无害的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lead a charmed life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.32,0:59:54.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.75,0:59:56.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个应能保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should cover your tail fin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.75,0:59:58.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,罗马教廷的圣骨匣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reliquary. Straight from the Vatican.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.26,1:00:05.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,圣徒狄奥尼修斯的骨头 看起来像小手指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bone from St. Dionysius. Looks like a pinkie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.76,1:00:07.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我为什么是我去做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remind me why l keep doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.70,1:00:10.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,腐臭的蛋和全人类的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rotten eggs and the safety of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.95,1:00:57.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去并不像洋娃娃的头发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't really look like doll's hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.78,1:00:59.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 红大个 你认为呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be honest, Red. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.75,1:01:02.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想我来帮你梳理得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm thinking about doing it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.89,1:01:05.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有什么发现?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you guys find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.66,1:01:06.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还没发现蛋 红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No eggs yet, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.82,1:01:08.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你在午餐休息吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you on a lunch break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.79,1:01:10.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.00,1:01:21.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个正在行动 我会掩护他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red's on the move. l'll cover him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.15,1:01:30.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.69,1:03:16.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是艾比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's Abe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.33,1:03:24.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的武器拿过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring your toy over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.63,1:03:30.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.40,1:03:32.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.37,1:03:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个 我会很快煎熟它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one. l'll fry him quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.71,1:03:38.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个 有两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two. There were two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.97,1:04:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.74,1:04:10.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个 回话 红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red. Come in, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.21,1:04:13.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里? 我接受不到信号 你到底在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your 20? l got no signal. Where the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.58,1:04:15.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的地形像瑞士硬干酪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like Swiss cheese in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.58,1:04:18.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 悠着点 我在追他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit tight, pal, l'm on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.30,1:04:38.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨莫艾尔 可以重生的地狱之犬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammael, hound of the resurrection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.88,1:04:43.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是已杀了你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't l kill you already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.36,1:04:56.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这讨厌的怪物!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You goddamn monster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.28,1:05:20.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.76,1:05:37.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的电话!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.23,1:05:40.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该伤害人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't hurt people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.96,1:06:02.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没打中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.91,1:06:24.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大脸怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, chunk-face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.85,1:06:29.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像你这样的大怪物 应该攻击得更好才是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do better than that, big monster like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.27,1:07:22.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请救救我的小猫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My kittens! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.87,1:07:24.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊 请救救我的小猫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody, please, get my kittens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.65,1:07:32.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才第二次约会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.98,1:07:34.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要用舌头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.13,1:07:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心我的小猫!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My kittens. Careful with them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.73,1:07:51.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,女士 不要烦我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady, give me a break!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.25,1:08:13.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.92,1:08:15.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.48,1:09:12.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克里 我接受到艾比的信号 我正赶回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clay, I'm getting a signal from Abe. I'm on my way back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.98,1:09:17.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 不要再上前了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy, don't take another step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.81,1:09:45.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.68,1:10:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人员伤亡 需要一辆救护车 立刻派来 收到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man down. l need an ambulance right away. Do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.92,1:10:24.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 坚持住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang in there, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.95,1:10:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人员伤亡 收到了吗 收到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man down. Do you read? Do you read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.83,1:10:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科瑞尔 莫斯 收到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quarry, Moss, do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.66,1:10:36.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科瑞尔 莫斯 收到了吗 有人员伤亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quarry, Moss, do you read me? Man down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.54,1:10:46.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外面的感觉真好 好久都没这样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels good to be outside. lt's been so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.74,1:10:49.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样不安全 谢尔曼女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that's... That's not safe Miss Sherman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.48,1:10:51.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请待在车里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stay in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.58,1:10:59.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢尔曼女士 请不要这样 你能坐下来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Miss Sherman. Please, can you come down, Miss Sherman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.26,1:11:09.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,风景真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.80,1:11:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笑一笑 那就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, a smile, huh? Yeah, that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.27,1:11:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.44,1:11:20.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.04,1:11:25.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等会你得再给我照一张 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll have to take another one later. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.94,1:11:50.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会好起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.01,1:11:55.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是每个人都这么幸运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everyone was so lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.74,1:11:59.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两位探员殉职了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had two agents die today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.78,1:12:02.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克里也许活不过今晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clay probably won't survive the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.38,1:12:05.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 曼宁 现在请别提这些 - 我想你的问题是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not now, Manning, please. - My problem with you:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.82,1:12:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做事不顾后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're reckless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.46,1:12:11.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人信任你 让你做团队的头儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}These men trusted you to lead them as a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.96,1:12:13.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.70,1:12:16.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我比你更了解这些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l knew those men better than you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.73,1:12:20.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么 你就安心了 - 不 这并不使我安心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That makes it all right, then. - No, it doesn't make it all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.44,1:12:24.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但我至少制服了那玩意儿 是吧? - 是的 你制服了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But l stopped that thing, didn't l? - Yes, you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.17,1:12:26.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的工作 这就是为什么我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's what you do. lt's why we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.47,1:12:29.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一种洞察力 你了解这些怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have an insight. You know monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.68,1:12:31.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you trying to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.68,1:12:35.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这整件事是一场闹剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole thing is a farce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.68,1:12:37.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为到最后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because in the end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.19,1:12:41.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...在你杀光 捉光了所有的怪物后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...after you've killed, after you've captured every freak out there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.46,1:12:44.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...还是有个剩下的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's still one left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.13,1:12:46.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.07,1:12:52.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,曼宁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Manning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.97,1:12:55.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我能更友好一些 但...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l wish l could be more gracious, but....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.94,1:13:04.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.98,1:13:08.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布隆姆教授 我只在这里待一个周末{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's only for the weekend, Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.52,1:13:11.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then l shall be on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.15,1:13:15.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该四处看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you should have a look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.29,1:13:17.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里变化不小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made some changes around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.00,1:13:28.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把这个东西关起来 马上就关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l want that thing locked up, starting now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.94,1:13:30.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就关! 你听到...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now! Do you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.07,1:13:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就关 你听到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.14,1:13:35.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把他关起来! - 他一点也没改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Locked up! - Nothing's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.28,1:13:36.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,家 甜蜜的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home sweet home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.71,1:13:37.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.51,1:13:42.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.22,1:13:47.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把她带来了 兄弟 你把她带来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did it, buddy. You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.49,1:13:52.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.83,1:13:54.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.44,1:14:04.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.04,1:14:07.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你手腕上是什么东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's that on your wrist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.14,1:14:09.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.91,1:14:14.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是我从心理治疗中学来的 - 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt's something l learned in therapy. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.32,1:14:17.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感到沮丧 就拉一次橡皮圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm depressed, one rubber band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.49,1:14:19.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感到焦虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm impatient...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.52,1:14:23.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉两次橡皮圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...two rubber bands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.52,1:14:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.60,1:14:29.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我该捆紧你的一个橡皮圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe l should get you a fresh pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.27,1:14:34.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 也许两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, maybe two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.54,1:14:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.61,1:14:46.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把这些食物放在这里 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm gonna put these over here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.15,1:14:48.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute. One minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.89,1:14:53.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 迈尔斯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Myers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.62,1:14:55.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你是一个善于言辞的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're a talker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.99,1:14:59.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就表达"需要"来说 有没有更好的词语?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a good word, a solid word, for ''need''?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.39,1:15:00.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.73,1:15:02.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,..."需要"本身就是很好的词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...''need'' is a good, solid word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.90,1:15:04.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太直白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too needy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:06.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始吃吧? 还有墨西哥烤玉米片要送来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start in, okay? You got nachos coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.60,1:15:09.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,墨西哥烤玉米片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nachos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.90,1:15:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.67,1:15:13.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这整堆垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.24,1:15:16.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁养了小孩吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who had babies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.01,1:15:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹 有些事你得听我说说 这...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz, there's something l need for you to hear, and it's....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.15,1:15:25.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间长吗?因为我马上要出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will it take long? Because l'm actually going out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.42,1:15:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.96,1:15:30.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是"离开" 还是去散心?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Out'' out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.49,1:15:35.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出去喝杯咖啡 但你继续 读吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, for a cup of coffee, but go ahead, read.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.66,1:15:37.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.67,1:15:41.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 迈尔斯带我出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Myers is taking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.00,1:15:44.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的红辣椒酱快冷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, your chili's getting cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.01,1:15:46.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不饿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.11,1:15:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要跟我说些事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ls there something you'd like me to hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.34,1:15:53.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是一个列表 但还未完成 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt's just a list. lt's not finished. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.21,1:15:55.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那么 迟点再说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.92,1:15:57.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回头见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.95,1:16:01.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还需要什么? - 不用你管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything else you need? - Not from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.22,1:16:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好 晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.43,1:16:05.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.40,1:16:18.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,研究对象 卡尔·卢布里切特·克鲁南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject: Karl Ruprecht Kroenen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.91,1:16:21.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1897年生于德国慕尼黑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born in Munich, 1897.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.88,1:16:25.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,患上一种叫"外科手术嗜爱狂"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suffered from a masochistic compulsion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.65,1:16:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...的虐待狂强迫症{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...commonly known as surgical addiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.39,1:16:36.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,眼皮都被移除了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both eyelids surgically removed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.06,1:16:41.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...上嘴唇...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...along with his upper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.33,1:16:44.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...和下嘴唇也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and lower lip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.73,1:16:50.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,血管中的血液早已干涸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood in his veins dried up decades ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.51,1:16:55.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩尘土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only dust remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.08,1:17:02.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的恐怖意志...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What horrible will...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.95,1:17:06.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...能使这样的生物还活着?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...could keep such a creature as this alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.05,1:17:42.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.86,1:17:45.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.93,1:17:49.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.77,1:17:59.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 红大个 别再逃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Red. Not again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.71,1:18:03.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来份那种甜饼 你这儿有油炸圈饼吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one of those cookies. Do you have any doughnuts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.44,1:18:05.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 朋友 来个"熊爪"怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, pal. How about a bear claw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.53,1:18:26.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还想要些什么吗? 店快打烊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want anything else? The shop's closing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.80,1:18:28.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.84,1:18:30.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen about....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.94,1:18:33.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我钦佩他 他是自然之力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l admire him. He's a force of nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.71,1:18:36.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩出来要谈些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you two talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.48,1:18:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事会如此的迷人和重要?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is so fascinating, so important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.95,1:18:42.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他太顽固而且不听劝告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He's determined, unstoppable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.48,1:18:44.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人会把那看作自以为是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people would call that cocky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.65,1:18:47.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他只是太好强了 - 是啊 他就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's just strong. - Yeah. That he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.32,1:18:48.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿了你的那份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, l've got yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.56,1:18:54.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叔叔 他以前常说 我们喜欢人是因为他们的优点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My uncle, he used to say we like people for their qualities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.33,1:18:57.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但爱上人却是因为他们的缺点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but love them for their defects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.57,1:19:00.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他爱你 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He loves you, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.60,1:19:04.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对他呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.67,1:19:08.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说不清 我和他是青梅竹马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know. l grew up with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.24,1:19:13.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在每当我一看到他 我就感到困扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now every time l see him, l get confused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.38,1:19:16.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几乎每天他都在我的脑海里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's hardly a day that goes by that he's not in my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.52,1:19:17.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.82,1:19:20.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我都感觉好像他在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l feel like he's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.36,1:19:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.99,1:19:29.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你爱吃油炸圈饼吗 我有两个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like doughnuts? l got two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.23,1:19:33.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 很好吃 - 我还有个甜饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. That was nice. - l got a cookie, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.20,1:19:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要糖吗? - 谢谢你 不要糖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sugar? - No. No sugar. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.60,1:19:38.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 不要给她奶油和糖 她喜欢喝黑咖啡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No cream and sugar, moron. She takes it black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.54,1:19:41.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我这里有些牛奶 - 不用 我不喝牛奶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l got some milk here. - No. l'm okay. l don't take milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.24,1:19:43.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说对了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.31,1:19:48.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.28,1:19:50.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.62,1:19:54.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.82,1:19:58.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.36,1:20:02.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她为他照相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took his picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.17,1:20:07.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.01,1:20:18.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真冷啊 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's freezing, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.18,1:20:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喝咖啡使我感到暖和{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coffee's warming me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.32,1:20:24.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那现在我们去干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.25,1:20:27.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,新泽西州的纽沃克 娱乐首府{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newark, New Jersey, entertainment capital of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.36,1:20:31.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你听上去像个游戏节目的主持人 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sound like a game-show host. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.40,1:20:36.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.20,1:20:42.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在执行任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm on a mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.15,1:20:48.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说说你的一些事 你从哪里来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, tell me something about you. Where do you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.65,1:20:51.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前大部分时间和我叔叔一起生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l lived with my uncle most of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.19,1:20:52.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来我去了弗吉尼亚州的匡提柯 当上了我班上的头名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then l went to Quantico, went to top of my class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.98,1:20:54.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不像...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm nothing like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.19,1:20:56.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要告诉别人见过我好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell anyone, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.17,1:21:01.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attaboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.67,1:21:11.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 他没有带上定位器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, he left his locator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.04,1:21:16.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们该派人去找他吗 - 够了 受够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shall we send out some scouts? - Enough, enough, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.02,1:21:20.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他永远也长不大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll never change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.75,1:21:22.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.46,1:21:25.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远都是小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.51,1:21:44.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sebastian Plackba, number 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.08,1:21:46.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在莫斯科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.98,1:21:49.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么人想对付我们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants us in Moscow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.03,1:22:39.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我老妈烤的饼干 - 她在笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My mom baked them. - She's laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.60,1:22:43.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她坐在公园的长椅子上 而且她在大笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's sitting on a park bench, and she's laughing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.87,1:22:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样了 我完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. l'm done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.81,1:22:48.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们看上去不像是间谍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't look like spies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.57,1:22:51.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.88,1:22:53.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看那个家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.71,1:22:57.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那阴险的小眼 那咧嘴的假笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those shady little eyes, that phony grin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.95,1:23:00.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会吃那个吗 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you going to eat that? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.05,1:23:05.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在打哈欠 他感到无聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, he's yawning. He's bored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.36,1:23:07.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老土的打哈欠花招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the old yawning trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.03,1:23:11.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着他的手臂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch his arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.34,1:23:21.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先他想要我的工作 接着他想要我的女友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}First he wants my job, then he wants my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.51,1:23:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们每人都有自己尽力隐藏的另一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we all have a side that we try to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.25,1:23:36.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.12,1:23:38.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.89,1:23:42.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁扔的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey, who threw that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.03,1:23:48.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧? - 还好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - Yeah, l'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.14,1:23:52.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扔得真准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.41,1:24:01.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sebastian Plackba, number 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.15,1:24:04.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是拉斯普亭的陵墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's Rasputin's mausoleum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.09,1:24:13.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了木偶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l see the puppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.59,1:24:16.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但那操纵木偶的人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.83,1:24:19.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the puppeteer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.53,1:24:21.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.30,1:24:24.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.94,1:24:27.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那纸的碎片...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scraps of paper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.57,1:24:30.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...丽兹突然爆发和回归{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Liz's sudden relapse and return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.54,1:24:32.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像在寓言中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bread crumbs on the trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.61,1:24:34.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用面包屑来标记道路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like in a fable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.81,1:24:36.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些事转移了他的注意力...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They both distract him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.62,1:24:39.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...并指引他到我要他去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and guide him exactly where l need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.92,1:24:41.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫斯科{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.25,1:24:43.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的宿命之地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}His destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.69,1:24:45.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而最后的一个线索...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the last clue...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.16,1:24:49.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...将是已故的布隆姆教授{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will be left by the late Professor Broom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.46,1:24:51.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你养大了这孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You raised the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.33,1:24:53.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教育了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nurtured him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.37,1:24:55.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以作为回报...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So in return...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.90,1:24:57.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我允许你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l will permit you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.67,1:25:02.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...看一眼未来的情形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a brief, brief glimpse of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.84,1:25:33.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他将打开地狱之门...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will open the portal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.17,1:25:36.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...带来世界的末日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and bring about the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.35,1:25:43.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果六十年前你杀掉他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only you had had him destroyed 60 years ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.02,1:25:46.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...那这一切就不会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...none of this would have come to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.35,1:25:49.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你又怎么可能知道呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, how could you have known?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.89,1:25:52.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的上帝选择了沉默{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your God chooses to remain silent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.69,1:25:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我的却与我同在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine lives within me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.16,1:25:58.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每次当我死掉并重生后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time l died and crossed over...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.70,1:26:04.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...就会带回...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a little more of the master...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.17,1:26:06.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...主人的一小部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...came back with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.14,1:26:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他向我展示了孩子的真名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He disclosed to me the child's true name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.38,1:26:13.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to know it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.38,1:26:17.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know what to call him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.02,1:26:22.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论你说或者做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing you can do or say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.95,1:26:25.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都无法改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...can change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.09,1:26:28.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l call him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.36,1:26:31.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.20,1:26:39.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.14,1:26:42.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会很快的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt'll be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.83,1:27:10.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直接过去告诉她你的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go there and tell her how you feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.40,1:27:13.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我老妈常说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom says that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.74,1:27:16.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 这没有那么简单 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's not... lt's not that easy, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.41,1:27:21.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 你才九岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, you're 9.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.05,1:27:24.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有老到可以给我建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not old enough to be giving me advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.62,1:27:29.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 停下来 - 那些人是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, stand by. - Who are those guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.16,1:27:40.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹 对不起 是布隆姆出事了 我们走吧 我们得找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz, l'm sorry. lt's Broom. Let's go. We need to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.03,1:27:42.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不! - 等等 发生了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Wait, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.07,1:27:44.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不会的! - 没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - lt's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.57,1:27:45.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不会是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.10,1:27:48.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能带她回去吗 - 不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you take her? - Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.98,1:29:39.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经三天没和任何人说过话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't spoken to anybody in three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.55,1:29:42.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一句也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.52,1:29:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他既不吃也不睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't eat, he won't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.62,1:29:47.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过他这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l've never seen him like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.86,1:29:48.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.53,1:29:51.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我该留下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should l stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.03,1:29:54.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留下来陪他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}With him, l mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.97,1:30:00.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我并不是一个问题解决专家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, l'm not much of a problem solver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.44,1:30:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三十年来 我只完成了魔方的两面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three decades, l've only completed two sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.18,1:30:07.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l do know this much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.78,1:30:10.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有麻烦的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf there's trouble...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.18,1:30:14.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我们这些怪胎只能相互信任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all us freaks have is each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.39,1:30:16.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我被困在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l'm stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.12,1:30:18.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.92,1:30:22.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以为我照顾好那大猴子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...take care of the big monkey for me, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.66,1:30:39.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(莫斯科 陀波科巴军事基地)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.77,1:31:08.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我收藏了很多有趣的事物...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have accumulated many objects of great interest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.94,1:31:11.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以保存我们的文化传统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...preserving our heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.25,1:31:17.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人 和我一样 都相信祖国母亲...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many, like me, believe Mother Russia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.52,1:31:21.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即将迎来一个历史性的重生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to be very close to a historic rebirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.12,1:31:24.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Rebirth''?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.82,1:31:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢那词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.17,1:31:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,二十吨重的岩石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty tons of stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.07,1:31:40.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是坠落到通古斯森林中的那块陨石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing fell from the sky into Tunguska Forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.17,1:31:42.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1908年6月30日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}June 30th, 1908.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.34,1:31:45.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时的罗曼诺夫王朝立刻占有了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Romanovs took possession of it immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.68,1:31:47.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就想得到它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l've wanted it for ages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.95,1:31:49.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're aware, of course...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.48,1:31:53.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法把它带出俄罗斯领土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's no way you'll get it out of Russian territory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.38,1:31:57.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道的 我们的客人会来俄罗斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is aware. Our guests are coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.16,1:32:02.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗克拉斯基郊外 距离莫斯科50英里 那是我们的目的地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Volokolamsk Fields, 50 miles from Moscow, that's where we're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.36,1:32:06.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号 这是我们唯一的线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sebastian Plackba, number 16. That's the only clue we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.90,1:32:09.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经收集并毁灭了数以千计的蛋...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've collected and destroyed thousands of eggs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.77,1:32:13.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们仍没有萨莫艾尔或拉斯普亭的踪迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but we have no trace of this Sammael or this Rasputin character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.91,1:32:17.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一得到许可和装备就行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We leave as soon as we get clearance and equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.61,1:32:19.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱男爵会一起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hellboy's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.78,1:32:22.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对此感到不愉快 但这次我是负责人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm not pleased about that, but l'll be in charge this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.98,1:32:27.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这次得隐秘行动 不然这怪物就别想再出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We either wrap this up or l'm closing this freak show for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.24,1:32:46.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.21,1:32:49.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...去莫斯科...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...come to Moscow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.17,1:32:51.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...如果你还去的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you're still going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.98,1:32:53.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.64,1:32:56.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有些话想说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l have something to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.52,1:33:00.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我理解你不喜欢我的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l understand what you don't like about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.09,1:33:02.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.69,1:33:05.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是恶魔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What l am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.76,1:33:09.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...这使你感到有些不适...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...makes you feel a little out of place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.79,1:33:10.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...想离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.96,1:33:12.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 红大个 我没有... - 听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Red, l don't... - Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.07,1:33:16.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不像迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm not like Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.74,1:33:20.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他才是你的归属{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He makes you feel like you belong...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.87,1:33:22.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...那真的很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which is good, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.38,1:33:31.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望可以改变自己的容貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l wish l could do something about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.99,1:33:35.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我无法做到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.99,1:33:40.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证两件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l can promise you two things:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.49,1:33:43.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一 我会永远是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, l'll always look this good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.87,1:33:50.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.50,1:33:54.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我决不放弃爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'll never give up on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.21,1:33:58.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,决不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.48,1:34:02.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.38,1:34:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(俄罗斯领空)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.59,1:34:20.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这上面刻的是萨莫艾尔 铭文写道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This engraving here represents Sammy. Text reads:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.36,1:34:24.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死一个会有两个重生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''One falls, two shall arise. Sammael.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.77,1:34:29.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须得同时把它们和蛋干掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to nail them all at once, and the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.57,1:34:31.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行动时不要恣意妄为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when we do, no mumbo jumbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.98,1:34:35.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双核Vulcan65型手雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double-core Vulcan-65 grenades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.98,1:34:39.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上面已装好定时器 设置好就离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've installed a handy little timer. You set it, you walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.52,1:34:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,线会拉开安全别针{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cable pulls the safety pins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.75,1:34:42.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,轰隆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaboom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.92,1:34:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,容易清理容易使用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy to clean, easy to use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.92,1:34:49.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(莫斯科 维罗克拉斯基郊外)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.80,1:34:55.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火花对红大个讲话 听到吗请回话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sparky to Big Red. Do you read me? Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.87,1:34:59.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火花?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Sparky''?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.34,1:35:01.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁想出来的? 迈尔斯吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who came up with that? Myers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.94,1:35:04.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我们现在要离开主车道 抓紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we're leaving the main road, so hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.14,1:35:07.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这最好就是那地方 我快要晕车呕吐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This better be the place or l'll puke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.45,1:35:16.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好出来看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better come out and see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.70,1:35:32.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,塞巴斯蒂安公墓 第十六号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sebastian Plackba, number 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.85,1:35:46.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 我们永远无法找到那陵墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it. We're never gonna find Rasputin's mausoleum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.18,1:35:48.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这简直就是一座城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's practically a city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.79,1:35:51.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又臭又脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it stinks, and it's muddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.26,1:35:56.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议先回去找个旅馆 整顿好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l think we go back, we check into the hotel, we regroup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.43,1:35:58.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃完早饭后再来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}After breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.43,1:36:01.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要做的就是建立起一个方格图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l think what we have to do here is we have to make a grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.07,1:36:07.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们按图的象限进行搜寻 也许用卫星照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go in by quadrants. Maybe satellite photography.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.51,1:36:12.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我来问路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask for directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.78,1:36:16.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.16,1:36:30.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 宝贝 帮我找一个会说话的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, baby, find me a talker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.18,1:36:50.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.97,1:37:12.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.37,1:37:14.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.37,1:37:16.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.21,1:37:21.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.81,1:37:24.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这太荒谬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.75,1:37:28.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主管是我 不是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l run this show, not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.45,1:37:30.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙只会惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy's nothing but trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.49,1:37:34.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 过去十分钟了 我们走吧 - 你能不能闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ten minutes, we're out of here. - Will you shut up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.13,1:37:37.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就让他这样去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and let him do his thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.26,1:37:39.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人还有能量棒吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody got a PowerBar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.03,1:37:44.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.40,1:37:48.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再走六十英尺 同志们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty feet further, comrades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.74,1:37:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接着进入第三排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And three rows in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.08,1:37:54.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他背上的是什么鬼东西?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that on his back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.98,1:37:57.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是伊凡·克里门托维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This here is lvan Klimentovich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.92,1:37:59.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说"你好" 伊凡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say ''hi,'' lvan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.85,1:38:02.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走那条路 红猴子!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.49,1:38:03.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.93,1:38:18.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伊凡说下面是一个错综复杂的通道网络{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lvan says there's a whole network of tunnels down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.94,1:38:20.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绵延数英里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goes on for miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.34,1:38:27.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家靠紧些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.45,1:38:30.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好找对了地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better be right about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.86,1:38:41.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们不分散就没有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be all right as long as we don't separate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.41,1:39:01.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,火花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sparky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.58,1:39:05.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉每个人打开他的定位腰带 如果有人看到了什么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell everyone to turn their locator belts on. Anybody sees anything....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.38,1:39:06.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会说"马可"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll say ''Marco.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.75,1:39:07.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,波罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Polo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.22,1:39:11.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确信要这么做? - 以一到十的刻度: 二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure about this? - On a scale of one to ten: two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.12,1:39:15.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 侦察员小子 她会照顾你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, Boy Scout, she'll take care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.46,1:39:17.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她很强的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a tough one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.80,1:39:21.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.74,1:39:35.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问问你的好友这条路还有多远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask your buddy how far this thing goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.40,1:39:53.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在我背上怎么样 伊凡?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing up there, lvan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.70,1:39:57.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我有腿 我会踢你的屁股{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.80,1:40:00.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能帮我抱一会儿吗 他太消极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind holding this guy for a while? He is so negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.12,1:40:17.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那究竟是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.93,1:40:27.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很大的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.63,1:40:29.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 莱姆 跟我来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lime, come with me. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.53,1:40:32.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 停在原地!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Stay put!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.34,1:40:37.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.68,1:40:39.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.64,1:40:40.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.78,1:40:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是主管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.98,1:40:45.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在要往回走 你可以打开那扇门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna go back. You can take that door apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.05,1:40:49.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管那是什么 它正来攻击我们 现在必须得前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, it's coming for us. Now, we gotta move forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.85,1:40:51.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莱姆 我们走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lime, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.36,1:40:54.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay put!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.29,1:40:59.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你! 我不怕你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you! l am not afraid of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.83,1:41:02.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了算! 我们回去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm in charge! We go back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.80,1:41:10.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是死了的好!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.07,1:41:36.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.43,1:42:12.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,音乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.11,1:42:56.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的刺得很深{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really went deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.65,1:43:04.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's wrong with you?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.01,1:43:29.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.05,1:43:31.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你报仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ass is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.39,1:43:45.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什么 你这狗娘养的纳粹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you laughing at, you Nazi son of a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.79,1:44:13.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.75,1:44:37.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全都给你 针头脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all for you, pinhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.92,1:44:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.73,1:44:50.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在做什么? - 抽一支{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Having a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.46,1:44:52.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从不那样点烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never light a cigar that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.36,1:44:53.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你用木制火柴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You use a wooden match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.20,1:44:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要保持你的品味 知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preserves the flavor. You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.71,1:45:09.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.45,1:45:11.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.55,1:45:20.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他认为你我之间...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he thinks you and l....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.03,1:45:23.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是他对我发火的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why he's mad at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.00,1:45:32.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但那不是真的 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not true, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.94,1:45:34.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.14,1:45:38.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的 你对我的那种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that, you know, you feel that way about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.74,1:45:41.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在想知道这个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know that here? Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.68,1:45:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.89,1:45:52.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个 白大个 不管怎样 男人们都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red, white, whatever. Guys are all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.96,1:45:56.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.16,1:45:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到他们了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you found them yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.10,1:46:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就在我的下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got them right below me. It's a matter of minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.23,1:46:04.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.57,1:46:11.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以快一点吗这里怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you hurry up? Because it's a little spooky in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.88,1:46:13.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.95,1:46:18.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.95,1:46:22.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢退回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's back out real slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.45,1:46:22.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢退回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's back out real slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.34,1:46:42.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯 准备好手雷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myers, ready your grenades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.27,1:46:46.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马可 马可 马可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marco. Marco. Marco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.11,1:46:49.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快挪动你的大红屁股赶过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your big, red butt over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.05,1:46:57.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来了 孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'm coming for you, kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.35,1:47:58.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不准玩骑肩游戏!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No piggybacks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.49,1:48:05.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下去 你们这些...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me, you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.89,1:48:09.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹 不要去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.09,1:48:12.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们会杀掉他 快做点什么!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna kill him! Do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.10,1:48:14.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.70,1:48:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打我 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hit me. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.53,1:48:17.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.80,1:48:20.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快打我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.58,1:48:32.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.92,1:49:44.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们全部在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are all here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.22,1:49:46.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.26,1:49:50.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像所许诺的一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the way it was promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.76,1:49:55.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这人醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.20,1:50:02.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你带来了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.21,1:50:41.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}''And l looked...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.05,1:50:44.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...看见了一位天使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and beheld an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.05,1:50:50.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他的右手中 握着打开无底深渊的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in his right hand, the key to the bottomless pit.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.55,1:50:51.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他的右手中 握着打开无底深渊的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in his right hand, the key to the bottomless pit.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.56,1:50:58.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在多博尔斯克的乡下时就听过这句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}These were the words l heard as a peasant boy in Tobolsk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.56,1:51:00.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在 这扇门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.36,1:51:03.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通过奥格都·杰哈德送来的门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sent by the Ogdru Jahad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.20,1:51:09.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们终于可以来到这世界了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so that they might at long last enter our world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.64,1:51:13.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那钥匙 就是你那毁灭一切的右手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the key, the right hand of doom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.61,1:51:16.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你那只石手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your stone hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.45,1:51:18.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那是用来做什么的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you think it was made for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.82,1:51:22.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the locks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.39,1:51:24.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要打开 红大个! 不要打开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it, Red! Don't do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.86,1:51:28.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.83,1:51:33.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lmagine it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.53,1:51:35.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个伊甸园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Eden...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.80,1:51:37.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为你和她而设{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for you and her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.53,1:51:39.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.60,1:51:41.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.11,1:51:45.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就用她的灵魂来交换吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln exchange for her soul, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.58,1:51:52.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开那扇门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.42,1:51:56.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.82,1:51:59.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如你所愿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.66,1:52:02.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.78,1:52:23.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.86,1:52:34.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她的灵魂去了另一个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her soul awaits on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.19,1:52:37.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想让她回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf you want her back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.33,1:52:39.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...open the door and claim her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.10,1:52:48.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的真名就刻在这些枷锁上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your true name is inscribed around the locks that hold you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.91,1:52:50.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法打破它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot break them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.57,1:52:53.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你有多么的强壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...no matter how strong you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.28,1:52:55.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,月蚀开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eclipse has begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.52,1:53:00.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的真名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your true name...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.45,1:53:03.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,念出来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...say it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.09,1:53:11.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成为钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Become the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.27,1:53:22.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.67,1:53:26.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿努·恩·拉玛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anung un Rama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.78,1:53:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再念一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.58,1:53:31.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿努·恩·拉玛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anung un Rama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.53,1:55:58.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开最后的锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the final lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.50,1:56:02.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回想起真正的你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember who you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.52,1:56:25.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 我活了足够长的岁月来知晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, l have lived long enough to know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.86,1:56:28.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为这世界 一滴眼泪也不值得流下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not a tear will be shed for this world!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.46,1:56:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.16,1:56:32.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲留给你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father gave you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.86,1:56:34.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你没有选择!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.36,1:56:35.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开它!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.37,1:56:39.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快打开它!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.13,1:57:05.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.00,1:57:09.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做出了选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l chose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.75,1:57:25.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远无法完成你的宿命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never fulfill your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.55,1:57:29.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远不会了解你的真正力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never understand the power inside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.69,1:57:32.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会找到方法像这样活下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l'll just have to find a way to live with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.17,1:57:45.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.80,1:57:47.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你都干了些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.17,1:57:50.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've killed me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.01,1:57:52.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个无足轻重的小人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...an insignificant man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.04,1:57:55.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你却带来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have brought forth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.15,1:57:58.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.39,1:58:08.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myers, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.18,1:58:30.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱对我们来说没有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell will hold no surprises for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.83,1:58:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿了手雷腰环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l took a grenade belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.60,1:58:49.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这该死的东西坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The damn thing's broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.60,1:58:56.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保护她 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep her safe, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.94,1:58:59.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生了什么 不要离开她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happens, don't leave her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.08,1:59:01.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会离开她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.19,1:59:10.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很好 迈尔斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay, Myers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.89,1:59:13.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.99,1:59:15.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.16,1:59:20.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拉开导线就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just pull the cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.76,1:59:22.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没怪过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l didn't get you anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.10,1:59:27.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你独自一人能应付吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to be okay alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.34,1:59:32.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它能有多厉害?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How big can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.78,1:59:40.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.53,1:59:59.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.95,2:00:50.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这会很痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is gonna hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.32,2:01:22.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明早醒来时都会觉得疼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna be sore in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.27,2:01:44.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有脉搏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got no pulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.14,2:01:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也没有呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.75,2:01:59.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丽兹?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liz?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.49,2:02:01.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真笨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was so foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.82,2:02:35.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.40,2:02:44.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在黑暗中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}ln the dark...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.64,2:02:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到你的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l heard your voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.54,2:02:56.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.41,2:02:59.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}l said, ''Hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.88,2:03:03.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那个世界中的你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you on the other side...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.95,2:03:06.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让她自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.46,2:03:09.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.93,2:03:19.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了她我会过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For her l'll cross over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.67,2:03:25.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那时你就会后悔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then you'll be sorry.''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.83,2:03:48.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么使一个人成为真正的男人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes a man a man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.73,2:03:51.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前我的一个朋友曾经思考过这个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend of mine once wondered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.03,2:03:56.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是一个人的出身 还是他的生存方式?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it his origins? The way he comes to life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.57,2:03:58.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为都不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.57,2:04:00.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为是他所做出的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the choices he makes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.68,2:04:02.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是他选择怎样去开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not how he starts things...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.15,2:04:06.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是他选择怎样去结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but how he decides to end them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.18,2:06:17.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家去哪儿了？我还在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys? l'm still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.42,2:06:21.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
